* linguist-language=TypeScript
# Committed game assets under packages/game/public/ (generated by
# scripts/sync-assets.mjs from the repo-root assets/ sources, which live in
# git lfs).
# Binaries go to lfs; the manifests and map XML stay as readable text so
# hulls.json / turrets.json / maps.json are reviewable in a diff.
public/**/*.3ds filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
public/**/*.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
public/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
public/**/*.mp3 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
public/**/*.wav filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
public/**/*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
public/*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
